# Aliases

## View Aliases
```powershell
Get-Alias
```

### Common Aliases
- `dir` → `Get-ChildItem`
- `cd` → `Set-Location`
- `echo` → `Write-Output`
- `cat` → `Get-Content`

---

# Module Management

## Find Modules
```powershell
Find-Module -Name "PowerShell*"
```

## Install Modules
```powershell
Install-Module -Name "PowerShellGet"
```

---

# File System Navigation

## View Files and Directories
```powershell
Get-ChildItem
```

### Specific Path
```powershell
Get-ChildItem -Path C:\Users
```

---

## Change Directory
```powershell
Set-Location -Path ".\Documents"
```

---

# Creating Files and Folders

## Create Folder
```powershell
New-Item -Path ".\captain-cabin\captain-wardrobe" -ItemType "Directory"
```

## Create File
```powershell
New-Item -Path ".\captain-cabin\captain-wardrobe\captain-boots.txt" -ItemType "File"
```

---

# Removing Files and Folders

## Delete File
```powershell
Remove-Item -Path ".\captain-cabin\captain-wardrobe\captain-boots.txt"
```

## Delete Folder
```powershell
Remove-Item -Path ".\captain-cabin\captain-wardrobe"
```

---

# Copying Files

## Copy File
```powershell
Copy-Item -Path .\captain-cabin\captain-hat.txt -Destination .\captain-cabin\captain-hat2.txt
```

---

# Reading File Contents

## Display File Content
```powershell
Get-Content -Path ".\captain-hat.txt"
```

---

# Important Commands Learned

## List commands starting with Remove
```powershell
Get-Command -Name Remove*
```

## Alias equivalent of echo
```powershell
Write-Output
```

## Get examples for New-LocalUser
```powershell
Get-Help New-LocalUser -examples
```

## Alternative of Windows type command
```powershell
Get-Content
```

---

# Key Learnings
- PowerShell is object-oriented
- Cmdlets follow Verb-Noun syntax
- `Get-Help` is essential for learning commands
- Aliases make PowerShell easier for CMD/Linux users
- PowerShell simplifies file and directory management using unified cmdlets
- Modules can extend PowerShell functionality

# Cybersecurity Relevance
PowerShell is heavily used in:
- System administration
- Automation
- Ethical hacking
- Active Directory management
- Red team and blue team operations
- Windows enumeration and scripting
